---
import Layout from '@layouts/Page.astro';
import LinkList from '@components/LinkList.astro';
import { photographyAwards } from '@links/registry';
import AwardExhibit from '@components/AwardExhibit.astro';
---

<Layout title="No Frames International Youth Photo Contest 2026">
  <LinkList slot="sidebar" items={photographyAwards} orientation="vertical" />

  <AwardExhibit slot="hero"
    image="/images/photography_awards/no-frames-2026-colony-panorama.jpg"
    alt="A colony of king penguins standing in a row among golden grass, with the sea behind them in Patagonia."
    title="ColonyPanorama" year={2026} result="Honorable Mention"
    place="Patagonia, Chile"
    contest="No Frames International Youth Photo Contest 2026"
    division="Nature · under 14" />

  <p class="intro">
I entered the V International Youth Photo Contest "No Frames," run by the Association of Photographers Eurasia and
recognized by the International Association of Art Photographers (IAAP). There were 891 young photographers from 24
countries and over 11,600 photos entered across ten sections. My photo "ColonyPanorama," of a king penguin colony in
Patagonia, received an Honorable Mention in the under-14 category of the Nature section.
  </p>


  <p>In total, 13 of my photos were accepted into the exhibition:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Black and White:</strong> The Eternal Triangle</li>
    <li><strong>Staged Photography / Portrait:</strong> The Camel Rider, Aswan Elder, Egyptian Man with Cat, Smoke Break</li>
    <li><strong>Nature:</strong> ColonyPanorama, Duo Portrait, Penguin Parade, Group Stroll</li>
    <li><strong>Daily Life:</strong> Cinderello, SF Skate Park</li>
    <li><strong>Visions of Tomorrow:</strong> Tangled Dreams</li>
    <li><strong>Heritage of Humanity:</strong> The Path to Philae</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    See the <a href="https://noframes-photofest.com/?lang=eng">contest website</a> and the
    <a href="https://theiaap.com/contests/join/1895/1895_accepted_web.pdf">full list of accepted photos</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
